<title>USA: Saks to buy three Dayton locations.</title>
<headline>Saks to buy three Dayton locations.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saks Holdings Inc said on Wednesday it has agred to acquire three Texas store locations that are operated by Dayton Hudson Corp's Marshall Field &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The stores are located in the Houston Galleria, the Dallas Galleria and the Town &amp; Country Mall in Houston, Saks said. The Town &amp; Country Mall location is a new site, while the other locations would replace smaller Saks stores, the company said.</p>
<p>Saks plans to enter the Austin market and expand its existing presence in San Antonio, it said.</p>
<p>The deal with Dayton Hudson is expected to close December 30, 1996, the company said.</p>
</text>
